OL,3,GNEWSASister of Omagh bomb victim says
OL,4,Aofficer's pre-recorded video evidence a
OL,5,A'farce'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Omagh bomb inquiry has heard
OL,8,Fpre-recorded video evidence from a
OL,9,Fsenior Irish police officer about the
OL,10,Fstolen car used to transport the bomb
OL,11,Fwhich killed 29 people including a
OL,12,Fwoman pregnant with unborn twins.
OL,14,FDet Supt Emmett Casserly of An Garda
OL,15,FSiochana (Irish police) was questioned
OL,16,Fby the inquiry team on 1 September in
OL,17,FDublin.
OL,19,FThe Irish government had to change the
OL,20,Flaw to enable him to give evidence.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
