OL,3,GNEWSASister of Omagh bomb victim says
OL,4,Aofficer's pre-recorded video evidence a
OL,5,A'farce'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever Claire Hayes, whose brother
OL,8,FAlan Radford was killed in the 1998
OL,9,FReal IRA attack, described the Irish
OL,10,Fgovernment's cooperation in the inquiry
OL,11,Fas "a farce".
